spring.jpa.show-sql=true
Use code with caution.

3. JSON Parsing (Jackson)

Spring Boot auto-configures the Jackson library to convert your Java objects to JSON. You can customize how dates are formatted or how missing fields are handled:
properties
# Format all Java Date/Time objects globally
spring.jackson.date-format=yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss

# Do not include fields in the JSON response if their value is null
spring.jackson.default-property-inclusion=non_null

# Prevent errors when your backend receives unknown JSON properties
spring.jackson.deserialization.fail-on-unknown-properties=false
